================================================================================
Scenario: Codex + Grok (+ Claude, Cursor) enabled, refresh frequency 1 minute, cost usage on,
storage footprints on, Usage & Spend window closed, no user interaction.
Corpus: real local history (Codex sessions 1.7 GB, Grok 170 sessions). Host: Apple silicon, macOS 27.3.
